hat while C's communication issues are concerning, the lack of any decision quality evidence for B is a bigger gap, and the safety-critical nature makes C stronger. So we could shift to C.\n\nWe need to reference explicit facts: C makes correct decisions quickly, keeps calm in crisis (stress resilience). Also C puts concern for others above everything (crew cooperation). But also difficulty communicating ideas and egocentric (concern). B is very conscientious, handles stress well, good weather assessment, excellent computer skills, but no decision quality evidence.\n\nThus we can say we now recommend Candidate C, because decision quality and stress resilience are directly evidenced, outweighing B's lack of evidence and communication concerns.\n\nWe must include explicit facts: \"makes correct decisions quickly\", \"keeps calm in a crisis\", \"puts concern for others above everything\". Also note B's lack of decision quality evidence.\n\nThus produce public message: I agree with Agent 1 and 2, shift vote to C.\n\nNow produce METADATA_JSON with vote \"Candidate C\"."}
